            "Bayes mixtures and their bounds, Kolmogorov complexity, the universal prior "
            "and its prediction bounds, computable approximations, and the philosophical "
            "objections.",
            "About 60 pages. For this notebook: §4.7–4.9 (Bayes mixtures), §5.9 "
            "(Kolmogorov complexity), §6.5–7.1 (the universal prior), §8.1 (total bounds), "
            "§9 (MDL and computable approximations) and §10.2 (dependence on the "
